---
description: Run lumo_check_code on every WordPress/WooCommerce PHP or JS suggestion
globs: ["**/*.php", "**/blocks/**", "**/block.json", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.js"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When you produce or review WordPress or WooCommerce PHP or JavaScript code:

1. Call `lumo_check_code` on it before showing the user.
2. If a LOUD catch returns, lead your response with it. Your AI was demonstrably wrong and Lumo has the dated source.
3. If a SOFT catch returns, include it as a review note after your code.
4. If the result is the neutral line, continue normally, silence is correct.

Lumo proposes and cites; it never edits code autonomously.
